  "overview": "**Druids** is a light-first design system anchored on `#ffffff` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#451481` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `Roboto Mono` (68px display down to 14px body), unified by `6px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Datadog**. Source: live stylesheet extraction (https://druids.datadoghq.com/). Inventory: **91** colors, **11** typography steps, and **11** documented components (all rights reserved license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 11 component tokens with documented paddings: `6px 2px`, `8px 12px`, `2px`, `6px 12px`, `12px 14px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#eaf6fc` cards; separate sibling sections using `#e2e5ed` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 0 4px #d9d9d9`) paired with `#e2e5ed` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#451481` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#ffffff` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#451481` with `#f7f7f8` text (11.7:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Roboto Mono` headings with `Roboto Mono` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `6px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (6px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#eaf6fc` surface shifts and `#e2e5ed` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `6px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `icon-module_rL-JZG_druids_search-bar_error-icon` fields and secondary buttons."
}
